WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.238 --> 00:00:09.740
&gt;&gt;&gt; Russia's most prominent

00:00:09.874 --> 00:00:12.543
opposition leader alexei navalny

00:00:12.543 --> 00:00:14.545
had already been living in

00:00:14.545 --> 00:00:16.680
hellish conditions, locked up in

00:00:16.814 --> 00:00:19.116
penal colony often in solitary

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:19.517
confinement.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.452
He's also been denied medical

00:00:21.585 --> 00:00:21.852
care.

00:00:21.986 --> 00:00:24.555
Well, today navalny's lawyers

00:00:24.555 --> 00:00:26.557
says he's been moved to an even

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:28.559
harsher callsary confinement

00:00:28.559 --> 00:00:30.027
facility for a maximum period of

00:00:30.161 --> 00:00:31.429
six months.

00:00:31.562 --> 00:00:33.164
Navalny himself tweeted about

00:00:33.297 --> 00:00:36.567
the torment and not being able

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:40.571
to see them for eight months and

00:00:40.671 --> 00:00:40.905
counting.

00:00:41.038 --> 00:00:42.873
Well, hardships make one tougher

00:00:43.007 --> 00:00:44.074
though I don't understand why

00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:45.476
this should apply to my

00:00:45.609 --> 00:00:46.143
children, too.

00:00:46.577 --> 00:00:48.579
Tonight one of his children is

00:00:48.646 --> 00:00:49.113
here.

00:00:49.246 --> 00:00:50.848
Dasha, I appreciate you being

00:00:50.981 --> 00:00:51.449
back with us.

00:00:51.582 --> 00:00:52.950
I'm sorry for this latest news.

00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:54.218
When you heard that your father

00:00:54.585 --> 00:00:56.754
would be moved to solitary cune

00:00:56.887 --> 00:00:57.621
finement, I mean what goes

00:00:57.755 --> 00:00:58.589
through your mind?

00:00:58.689 --> 00:01:00.825
&gt;&gt; Well, first of all, thank you

00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:02.993
so much, Anderson, for having me

00:01:03.127 --> 00:01:03.294
again.

00:01:03.427 --> 00:01:06.130
To answer your question in short

00:01:06.263 --> 00:01:08.199
what went through my mind is

00:01:08.599 --> 00:01:09.867
that Vladimir Putin and the

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.136
federal penalty service continue

00:01:12.269 --> 00:01:14.071
to practice their lawlessness

00:01:14.205 --> 00:01:16.140
and are slowly torturing and

00:01:16.273 --> 00:01:17.208
killing my father.

00:01:17.341 --> 00:01:19.376
Last time you and I talked we

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:22.246
were asking for doctors to see

00:01:22.613 --> 00:01:23.147
him because he had -- there was

00:01:23.447 --> 00:01:25.716
a big flu problem in the prison

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:27.518
and there still is.

00:01:27.651 --> 00:01:30.855
Since then they've deliberately

00:01:30.988 --> 00:01:32.656
infected him with the flu by

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:33.757
intentionally placing a sick

00:01:33.891 --> 00:01:34.959
person in his cell.

00:01:35.092 --> 00:01:37.795
They prescribed my father with

00:01:37.928 --> 00:01:39.196
antibiotics, which may seem

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:41.665
fine, but it was such a huge

00:01:41.799 --> 00:01:43.534
amount -- such a high dose that

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:47.404
he lost 7 kilos or pounds I

00:01:47.538 --> 00:01:49.940
think 15 or 16.

00:01:50.074 --> 00:01:52.810
You and I talked a few weeks ago

00:01:52.943 --> 00:01:55.312
and losing 15 pounds in that

00:01:55.446 --> 00:01:56.914
time is incredibly concerning.

00:01:57.047 --> 00:01:57.848
They are not actually treating

00:01:57.982 --> 00:01:59.884
his flu or his back problems.

00:02:00.017 --> 00:02:02.653
And on top of his health

00:02:02.653 --> 00:02:08.092
problems, the prison ward just

00:02:08.225 --> 00:02:11.328
moved him as you said to another

00:02:11.462 --> 00:02:12.663
colony and today they were

00:02:12.663 --> 00:02:15.165
supposed to release him from his

00:02:15.299 --> 00:02:16.901
penalty cell, and it was his

00:02:17.034 --> 00:02:17.601
11th term.

00:02:17.735 --> 00:02:19.603
And instead of moving him --

00:02:19.737 --> 00:02:21.772
instead they moved him to a

00:02:21.906 --> 00:02:26.243
penalty cell-type facility of

00:02:26.677 --> 00:02:26.944
maximum possible term of six

00:02:27.077 --> 00:02:27.278
months.

00:02:27.411 --> 00:02:28.679
There are no calls, no visits,

00:02:28.679 --> 00:02:32.716
no human conditions.

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:34.685
He's allowed to write 35 minute

00:02:34.685 --> 00:02:35.920
per day with a pen and paper,

00:02:36.053 --> 00:02:37.488
and he's allowed to have two

00:02:37.621 --> 00:02:37.788
books.

00:02:37.922 --> 00:02:39.857
These actions are clearly an

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:42.693
open strategy to destroy my

00:02:42.693 --> 00:02:45.930
father's physical health and

00:02:46.063 --> 00:02:48.365
maybe mental, too, by all means.

00:02:48.699 --> 00:02:49.800
And the reason why I called

00:02:49.934 --> 00:02:51.502
Putin out is because there's

00:02:51.635 --> 00:02:55.739
absolutely no way the colony

00:02:55.873 --> 00:02:57.474
would take these drastic

00:02:57.608 --> 00:02:58.776
measures without having a nudge

00:02:58.909 --> 00:03:01.946
from the Moscow government.

00:03:02.079 --> 00:03:04.715
And since he had 11 terms in the

00:03:04.715 --> 00:03:09.486
penal colony before, I can't be

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:10.721
certain that they -- they'll

00:03:10.854 --> 00:03:13.958
stick to the six months maximum

00:03:14.091 --> 00:03:15.593
term in the few facility.

00:03:15.726 --> 00:03:17.394
&gt;&gt; Was your family given any

00:03:17.528 --> 00:03:18.228
warning I mean by the

00:03:18.362 --> 00:03:19.363
authorities that this was

00:03:19.496 --> 00:03:19.697
coming?

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:20.731
Or do these things just happen

00:03:20.864 --> 00:03:23.200
and you learn about it

00:03:23.334 --> 00:03:23.567
afterward?

00:03:23.701 --> 00:03:26.170
&gt;&gt; No, absolutely not.

00:03:26.303 --> 00:03:30.174
They never tell us what's

00:03:30.307 --> 00:03:30.975
happening.

00:03:31.108 --> 00:03:32.743
My dad was transferred three

00:03:32.876 --> 00:03:36.880
times in the past few years

00:03:37.014 --> 00:03:39.083
without absolutely any knowledge

00:03:39.216 --> 00:03:41.185
of where he is or direction that

00:03:41.318 --> 00:03:41.986
he's going.

00:03:42.119 --> 00:03:43.387
There's absolutely no

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:44.922
communication from the colony,

00:03:45.055 --> 00:03:46.223
from the government about my

00:03:46.357 --> 00:03:47.424
father's conditions.

00:03:47.558 --> 00:03:49.627
&gt;&gt; So he's only allowed to write

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:53.163
for three to five minutes a day,

00:03:53.297 --> 00:03:56.266
and he's allowed two books.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.468
&gt;&gt; 35, yes.

00:03:57.601 --> 00:03:57.868
&gt;&gt; Wow.

00:03:58.002 --> 00:04:00.771
I mean, can he get through this?

00:04:00.771 --> 00:04:03.874
Can he -- can he survive six

00:04:04.008 --> 00:04:05.776
months in solitary confinement

00:04:05.909 --> 00:04:10.781
in these conditions in his cell?

00:04:10.781 --> 00:04:13.283
&gt;&gt; I mean we have to stay

00:04:13.417 --> 00:04:13.751
hopeful.

00:04:13.884 --> 00:04:16.387
I would say for those watching

00:04:16.787 --> 00:04:18.088
right now -- and thank you for

00:04:18.222 --> 00:04:20.124
watching -- and wondering how

00:04:20.257 --> 00:04:21.525
you can help, there are two

00:04:21.659 --> 00:04:21.859
things.

00:04:21.992 --> 00:04:24.128
The first is the power of social

00:04:24.261 --> 00:04:26.430
media and spreading the word is

00:04:26.797 --> 00:04:28.799
incredibly impactful even though

00:04:28.799 --> 00:04:30.034
some may not think so.

00:04:30.167 --> 00:04:31.568
You know, follow me or my dad on

00:04:31.702 --> 00:04:32.803
social media.

00:04:32.836 --> 00:04:33.837
Follow the anti-corruption

00:04:33.971 --> 00:04:35.239
foundation on social media to

00:04:35.372 --> 00:04:37.074
find out what's happening.

00:04:37.207 --> 00:04:41.245
Watch and spread the documentary

00:04:41.378 --> 00:04:43.514
"Navalny" and tell your friends

00:04:43.647 --> 00:04:44.048
about the situation.

00:04:44.181 --> 00:04:44.848
Create awareness.

00:04:44.982 --> 00:04:46.116
No person should be in prison

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:49.186
for simply not agreeing with the

00:04:49.319 --> 00:04:50.854
government especially an

00:04:50.988 --> 00:04:52.990
authoritarian government.

00:04:53.123 --> 00:04:54.825
And it's a critical aspect for

00:04:54.892 --> 00:04:57.494
any democratic country or

00:04:57.628 --> 00:04:58.462
system.

00:04:58.829 --> 00:05:01.899
And the second perhaps more I

00:05:02.032 --> 00:05:05.169
would say politically effective

00:05:05.302 --> 00:05:07.404
is call your or e-mail your

00:05:07.538 --> 00:05:09.006
local officials and ask how are

00:05:09.139 --> 00:05:10.841
they imposing sanctions and what

00:05:10.841 --> 00:05:18.048
are they doing to free Alex nee

00:05:18.182 --> 00:05:18.382
navalny.

00:05:18.515 --> 00:05:20.851
&gt;&gt; I appreciate your time.

00:05:20.851 --> 00:05:21.885
&gt;&gt; Thank you so much for having

00:05:22.019 --> 00:05:22.152
me.

00:05:22.286 --> 00:05:24.988
&gt;&gt; For more on the story how

